              ],
              "type": "align_justify"
            }
          ],
          "detailedDescription_md": "The &amp;quot;Distribution of Certified Seeds-Oil Seeds&amp;quot; scheme by the Agriculture-Farmers Welfare Department, Tamil Nadu, provides financial assistance to farmers by subsidizing the cost of certified oil seeds. This scheme also encourages the farmers to use high-quality seeds and improve agricultural productivity.\n&lt;br&gt;\n\n&lt;br&gt;\n\n",
